    "Listing product link opens a new tab (blocked by pane); product page loaded by navigate to the link's href without query.",
    "Screenshots intermittently failed or rendered blank because the pane was hidden; some clicks by coordinate had no effect.",
    "Removing item 1 removed its add-on (item 2) too, per the site's 'Remove gift?' dialog; both were own items.",
    "robots.txt disallows /cart$ and /checkout; /cart visited (recorded only). No checkout path opened.",
    "Increase-quantity click n23 showed no change; click n25 raised item 2 to qty 2. Exact attribution between the two is uncertain."
